The main function `traverse_xml_files` takes an XML file path as input and traverses the XML file using a non-recursive algorithm. It uses a callback function `handle_node` to process each node in the XML tree, which checks if the current node is an UE id and updates the configuration accordingly. We also use a node stack data structure to keep track of the current depth of the traversal.

