* Flexible logging mechanism that supports real-time monitoring and integration with cloud-based observability tools, providing detailed insights into transaction processing and system performance.

The tradeoffs involved in caching strategies, error handling, and concurrency control are carefully considered in this implementation to ensure that the service is both efficient and reliable.']

