To initialize the AES-256-CBC cipher, we use OpenSSL library's `EVP_EncryptInit_ex()` function to set the encryption algorithm and key. We also use PBKDF2 key derivation to derive an encryption key from a provided password using OpenSSL library's `PKCS5_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA1()` function.
