    // Data is invalid
}
```
### Monitoring and Logging of Errors and Edge Cases

To monitor and log errors and edge cases effectively, we use OpenSSL library's `ERR_get_error()` function to retrieve the error code from the last operation. We then use this error code to determine whether an error has occurred during encryption or decryption. If an error occurs, we log the error using a logger such as syslog or journalctl.
