    record_table_t *table = malloc(sizeof(record_table_t));

    // Add an image to the hash table
    add_record(table, 12345, 3.14);

    // Convert an image from JPEG to PDF format using a third-party library
    convert_image("input.jpg", "output.pdf");

    // Persist the data to disk using JSON and binary libraries
    persist_data(table, "data.json");

    // Deserialize the data from disk using JSON and binary libraries
    deserialize_data(table, "data.json");

    // Free the resources used by the hash table
    free(table);

    return 0;
}
```
Note that this is just one example of how you might implement this programming task as a modular C library. There are many different ways to do it, and the specific implementation will depend on your requirements and constraints.']

