The `deserialize_from_binary` function takes a pointer to the `Collection` structure and a file name, and deserializes the binary data from a file into an array of records and adds them to the collection. It uses the `fread` function from the C standard library to read the binary data from the file. If there is an error reading from the file, it returns an error message.

