The code also includes robust anomaly detection mechanisms that can identify and flag potential operational issues or unexpected data patterns, incorporating statistical models and machine learning for adaptive monitoring. The system is designed to handle sudden increases in data volume by dynamically adjusting resource allocation, and it considers the impact of peak loads on long-running processes and background tasks.

