The library ensures all RNTI values are unique within the array, manages error handling for insufficient unique RNTI availability, and prioritizes performance in high-throughput network environments. The library also integrates with an external RESTful API for periodic synchronization of CRC indication data with a remote database, reducing network latency and handling API failures through retry logic and exponential backoff strategies.

