The `DeserializeAsync` method uses an `SqlCommand` to select all rows from a table and serializes each row using the `BinaryFormatter`. It caches the data for repeated access patterns using a `Dictionary<string, object>`.

The `IntegrateIntoDatabaseAsync` method uses an `SqlConnection` to interact with the database. It uses `await command.ExecuteNonQueryAsync()` to insert each item into the database and `using (var transaction = _connection.BeginTransaction())` to handle data conflicts and updates gracefully using optimistic concurrency control.

